Bitcoin Deepa Brand Assets Licence
Version 1.0, November 2026

Copyright (c) 2026 Ceylon Cash (PVT) LTD. All rights reserved.

This repository holds the brand identity of Bitcoin Deepa: the names
"Bitcoin Deepa" and "Pearl of Satoshi", the Yaka mask symbol, the Sinhala
දීප glyph mark, the logos, wordmarks, app icons, profile pictures, slogan
artwork, patterns, the colour system and design tokens, and the brand
guidelines that describe them (together, the "Brand Assets").

The Brand Assets are the property of Ceylon Cash (PVT) LTD ("CeylonCash")
and are protected by trademark, copyright and other intellectual property
law. They are NOT open source. Publishing them in a public repository does
not place them under any open-source licence, including the AGPL-3.0
licence that covers Bitcoin Deepa's software.

1. Permitted use

   You may use the Brand Assets, unmodified and as the brand guidelines in
   this repository describe, only:

   a. to work on official Bitcoin Deepa projects, products, events and
      communications, as a member, contributor, contractor or partner of
      Bitcoin Deepa or CeylonCash;
   b. to refer to Bitcoin Deepa truthfully in news, reviews, education,
      commentary or listings (nominative reference), without implying that
      CeylonCash endorses, sponsors or is affiliated with you or your work;
   c. as CeylonCash has otherwise agreed with you in writing.

2. Not permitted

   Without prior written permission from CeylonCash, you may not:

   a. use the Brand Assets, or anything confusingly similar to them, in the
      name, logo or branding of your own product, service, project or
      organisation;
   b. alter, recolour, redraw, distort or combine the Brand Assets with
      other marks;
   c. present a modified product, fork or build in a way that could be
      mistaken for an official Bitcoin Deepa release;
   d. sell the Brand Assets, or merchandise bearing them;
   e. imply endorsement, partnership or official status.

3. Forks and redistribution

   If you fork this repository or redistribute Bitcoin Deepa software, you
   may keep the Brand Assets only for the purposes in section 1. A modified
   or independent distribution must carry its own name and branding and
   remove the Bitcoin Deepa marks and logo assets.

4. Contributions

   By submitting a contribution to this repository you confirm that you
   have the right to submit it, and you assign to CeylonCash, or where
   assignment is not possible grant CeylonCash an exclusive, perpetual,
   worldwide, royalty-free licence to, all rights in any brand artwork,
   design or wording you contribute, so that the brand stays under one
   owner. Each commit must be signed off under the Developer Certificate of
   Origin (see CONTRIBUTING.md).

5. No warranty

   The Brand Assets are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

6. Termination

   Permission under section 1 ends automatically if you breach this
   licence. CeylonCash may also withdraw permission for any use at any
   time by notice.

See TRADEMARK.md for the organisation's trademark policy. For permission
or questions, contact hello@bitcoindeepa.com.
